// Windows resource script: embeds the application icon into mikrotik-rif.exe.
//
// Compiled by build.rs via the `embed-resource` crate. The path below is
// relative to the repository root (the crate manifest dir), which is both the
// build script's working directory and this file's directory, so it resolves
// regardless of whether the resource compiler resolves relative to the .rc
// file or to the working directory.
1 ICON "assets/icon/icon.ico"
